4. Behaviour reproduced (no code copied)
----------------------------------------

To behave as GADS does, the Go code reimplements the behaviour of these
Perl modules and data, without copying their code. All are under the
Perl 5 licence unless stated.

  Dancer2, DBIx::Class, Log::Report, Template Toolkit,
  JSON::PP, YAML::XS (YAML-LibYAML), Text::CSV,
  DateTime::Format::CLDR and DateTime::Locale (en-US CLDR names; the
  Unicode CLDR data is under the Unicode License),
  Net::SAML2, Crypt::SaltedHash, Authen::OATH, Inline::Lua (ctrlo fork),
  File::MimeInfo (reads the freedesktop.org shared-mime-info database
  installed on the system, which is not included).
